                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="7IE0TgfvVyxq2MSAQDQT-36" value="The few functions that are present in AgreementManager can go to the StorageManager as helper functions and agreementManager can be removed. 90% of the code that was removed from AgreementManager was Storage logic anyway - this way we don&#39;t have more &#39;stuff&#39; that we need to pass around since all compontents more or less use storage anyway" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="7IE0TgfvVyxq2MSAQDQT-35">
