                <mxCell id="Tkg7loyrQP702Ur1c9dN-153" value="If not linked we can&#39;t slash since the peer could have been building on the wrong &#39;reality&#39; since someone performed a double sign&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In reality this shouldn&#39;t be the case, since we gosip all blocks and if someone perfomed a double sign it should be exchanged by all honest peers - so if it&#39;s not, we can assume they&#39;re dishonest but can&#39;t prove it so it&#39;s safe to disconnect&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;- maybe sleep for agreementTime if there was some race condtition and this block came before the block that prooves the double sign and if it&#39;s still the case that after sleeping you&#39;re not aware of the double sign, just disconnect - otherwise keep the connection if the fork is disputed&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="Tkg7loyrQP702Ur1c9dN-152">
